Package: codex-auth-switcher
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Codex Auth Switcher Maintainers <opensource@bruceblink.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: ca-certificates, @RUNTIME_DEPENDENCIES@
Homepage: https://github.com/bruceblink/codex-auth-switcher
Description: Manage Codex authentication profiles and model catalog
 Codex Auth Switcher provides a desktop application to switch Codex
 authentication profiles and manage the model catalog.
